    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d591">

                <pb facs="0621" n="505" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg505"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.516/56.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Blanchard to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please forward the following message to Wehrhane care of Hallgarten and Company,
                    New York: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Justice of peace wanted to execute order of judge of instruction ordering
                            removal of seal and transportation funds to another banking house, have
                            declared funds property of bank and depositors (not) to permit their
                            removal.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams.</hi>
                        </p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
